    "_postman_id": "34493f48-3fc8-4ace-b19c-0cb8c8d773b0",
    "name": "Donezo API Documentation",
    "description": "Complete reference for Donezo an offline-ffirst Kanban board API.\n\nThis API enables users to manage personal kanban boards with real-time synchronization across devices. Features include JWT-based authentication, task CRUD operations with soft-delete support, WebSocket real-time updates, and rate limiting to prevent abuse.\n\n**Base URL:** [http://localhost:3002](http://localhost:3002) (or ngrok URL for remote testing)\n\n**Authentication:** All task endpoints require JWT token in Authorization header: Bearer {token}\n\n**Rate Limits:**\n\n- Auth endpoints: 5 requests per 15 minutes\n    \n- Task endpoints: 60 requests per minute per user\n    \n\n**Response Format:** All endpoints return JSON. Errors include an 'error' property with description.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "53267893",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/53267893-34493f48-3fc8-4ace-b19c-0cb8c8d773b0?source=collection_link"
