        "description": "Creates a new user with email and password. Password is hashed using bcrypt before storage.\n\n**Request:** email, password  \n**Response (201):** user object with id and email  \n**Errors:** 400 (missing fields), 409 (email exists), 429 (rate limited)\n\n**Notes:**\n\n- Email must be unique\n    \n- Password must be at least 8 characters\n    \n- Passwords are not returned in responses"
