          "path": [
            "tasks"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Retrieves all tasks for authenticated user.\n\nReturns array of all tasks (including soft-deleted) belonging to the authenticated user. Use this to sync local state with server.\n\n**Headers:** Authorization: Bearer {jwt_token}  \n**Response (200):** Array of task objects  \n**Errors:** 401 (missing/invalid token), 429 (rate limited)\n\n**Notes:**\n\n- Tasks with deleted_at != null are soft-deleted but included in response for sync purposes\n    \n- Use updated_at timestamp for last-write-wins conflict resolution\n    \n- Tags are returned as array of strings"
      },
