        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/tasks",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "tasks"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Creates or updates multiple tasks in a single bath request.\n\nAccepts array of task objects and performs upsert (insert or update). Uses last-write-wins conflict resolution: server only accepts changes if incoming updated_at timestamp is newer than existing record. Soft-deletes are supported via is_deleted flag.\n\n**Headers:** Authorization: Bearer {jwt_token}  \n**Request Body:** { tasks: \\[...\\] } — Array of task objects  \n**Response (200):** Array of saved task objects  \n**Errors:** 400 (invalid data), 401 (missing/invalid token), 429 (rate limited)"
      },
